    The village is nothing but a blasted ruin. Its buildings are a charred wreckage of timbers and broken bricks. In a few places weeds are growing, but elsewhere you see the bleached white of bones. <br><p>
    汝决定……<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>寻觅生息之迹。<br><p><opt>...<indent>离开。
